{"bodyHtml":"\n \n <div id=root><div class=\"App grain\"><main class=\"relative z-[2]\"><section class=\"relative pt-40 pb-16 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-20 lg:pb-24 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-10 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-royal/15 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10\"><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-royal\" style=font-family:Satoshi>How We Work</span></div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><h1 class=\"mt-6 text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] leading-[1.02] font-serif text-cream max-w-5xl\">A 7-Step Process Built on <span class=\"italic text-cream/60\">Trust, Not Guesswork.</span></h1></div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><p class=\"mt-8 text-lg md:text-xl text-cream/60 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-light\">No black boxes. You'll know exactly what's happening at every stage — from first call to compounding growth.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 pb-20 lg:pb-24\"><div class=relative><div class=\"absolute left-[27px] md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/10 md:-translate-x-1/2\"></div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pr-16 text-right \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">01</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>1</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:ml-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Discovery</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">We dig into your business, audience, and goals before a single pixel, campaign, or illustration is started.</p></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:[direction:rtl]\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pl-16 [direction:ltr] \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">02</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>2</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:mr-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Strategy</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">We map which pillars — growth, AI content, branding, or web — actually move your business forward.</p></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pr-16 text-right \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">03</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>3</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:ml-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Design</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">Premium, conversion-focused design and creative work that reflects the quality of what you're building.</p></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:[direction:rtl]\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pl-16 [direction:ltr] \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">04</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>4</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:mr-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Build</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">Development, campaign setup, and creative production happen in parallel as one connected system.</p></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pr-16 text-right \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">05</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>5</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:ml-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Test</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">Every campaign, workflow, and web flow is checked before it touches a real customer.</p></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:[direction:rtl]\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pl-16 [direction:ltr] \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">06</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>6</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:mr-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Launch</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">A structured go-live, not a guess-and-hope release.</p></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"relative flex gap-8 md:gap-0 py-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:pr-16 text-right \"><span class=\"process-bg-number\">07</span></div><div class=\"relative flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-royal flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-xl z-10 [direction:ltr]\" style=transform:none>7</div><div class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-8 flex-1 [direction:ltr] md:ml-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-cream\">Growth</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-cream/60 leading-relaxed font-light\">Post-launch optimization, reporting, and iteration — because launch is the start, not the finish line.</p></div></div></div></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"mt-16 glass rounded-3xl p-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-cream\">Ready to start at Step 1?</h2><div class=mt-8><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium tracking-wide transition-colors duration-300 select-none px-9 py-4 text-sm bg-royal text-white hover:bg-cream hover:text-ink\" data-testid=process-cta href=/contact data-discover=true>Book Your Discovery Call <svg xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg width=18 height=18 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-width=2 stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=true><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></main><a data-testid=whatsapp-button href=\"https://wa.me/919399136819?text=Hi%20Drift%20Digitally%2C%20I%27d%20love%20to%20talk%20about%20a%20project.\" target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#25D366] text-white rounded-full shadow-2xl shadow-[#25D366]/30 pl-4 pr-4 py-4 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><svg width=24 height=24 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=currentColor aria-hidden=true><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164